---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const pageTitle = '30 Day Map Challenge 2024';
---
<BaseLayout pageTitle={pageTitle}>
  <article class="project-detail">
    <div class="project-detail-hero">
      <div class="project-detail-copy">
        <!-- <p class="project-summary">
          A map I did during the 30 Day Map Challenge in 2024.
        </p> -->
        <div class="project-facts">
          <p>Animated map</p>
          <p>2024</p>
          <p>R, Adobe Photoshop</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="project-richtext">
      <h2>Overview</h2>
      <p>
        In 2024 I made only one map, but what a map: the locations of all Oasis gigs that had ever happened before 2025, shown on a spinning Earth. 
        I was inspired by the reunion and thought it would be a fun way to use my skills.
      </p>

    <figure class="project-feature-media">
      <img
        src="/images/30daymapchallenge-2024-1.gif"
        alt="Animated map created for the 30 Day Map Challenge 2024."
      />
    </figure>


    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
